flowchart TD
    A[refuse the fence] --> B{does it parse?}
    B -->|no| C[say why, in the caption]
    B -->|yes| D[measure the diagram]
    D --> E[reserve rows in the answer]
    E --> F[draw with the frame]
    F --> G[the reader scrolls past it]
    G --> H[no cell of it is ever copied]
    H --> I[a copy takes the caption]
    I --> J[the diagram is a block]
